@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:きっとハンナさんは<br>火精の間に<br>最初からいたんです。<br>……すでに殺され、<br>死体となっていたのかも<br>しれませんが。|#0103Trial08_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ウチらがいた時、<br>あそこに死体が<br>あったってのか！？|#0103Trial08_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そうです！<br>きっと天井付近に<br>いたはずですよ。<br>棚の上とか！|#0103Trial08_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:けれど、<br>昨日撮られた<br>看守のカメラには<br>何も映ってない<br>みたいだけどね？|#0103Trial08_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:おそらくはトリックを<br>使ったはずです。<br>ミステリでよくあるものと<br>いったら、<br>【鏡】とかですかね！|#0103Trial08_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"きっとカメラに映らないよう、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_08_01\">細工</link>がされていたんです。<br>それに画像なんて<br>いくらでも<link=\"Objection_01_03_08_02\">修正</link>できますし！<br>他にも、みなさんが<br>別の部屋と<link=\"Objection_01_03_08_03\">勘違い</link>してた<br>可能性もあります。|#0103Trial08_Sherry004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:んなわけねーだろ……！<br>３人して<br>部屋を間違えるなんて……！|#0103Trial08_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そうでしょうか？<br>あの３つの部屋は<br>中の様子がすべて同じでした。<br>十分ありえる話だと<br>思いますけどね～。|#0103Trial08_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ともかく、<br>そうして密室状態が<br>完成した夜のこと……。|#0103Trial08_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR6,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_08_04\">地震</link>が起こったんですよ！<br>それで天井に隠されていた<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_08_05\">死体が落ちて</link>きて……<br>くくりつけられたロープで、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_08_06\">首吊り死体が完成</link><br>したんです！|#0103Trial08_Sherry007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんな都合良く<br>地震が起きるわけ<br>ねーだろ……！|#0103Trial08_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR15,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"もしかしたら<br>起こせたかもしれませんよ？<br>地下水が流れていて<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_08_07\">地殻変動</link>が起きたとか……。<br>そもそもただの偶然<br>だったかもですし！|#0103Trial08_Sherry008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんな大きな地震……<br>他の人が<br>気付かないなんて事、<br>あるんでしょうか……。|#0103Trial08_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:局所的な直下型地震なら<br>一瞬ですし、<br>ありえないとは<br>言い切れないと思いますよ！|#0103Trial08_Sherry009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……仮にそんな地震が<br>起こせるとしたら、<br>あなたぐらい<br>じゃないかしら？<br>持ち前の怪力の魔法でね。|#0103Trial08_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……ええっ！？<br>そんな疑い方されるなんて、<br>思ってもみませんでした！|#0103Trial08_Sherry010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:じゃあ<br>やっぱり推理撤回しますね！|#0103Trial08_Sherry011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

