@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:んな話通るか！|#0103Trial08_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


